TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2601.07042v1
AU  - MELI, ALEXANDER BERTOLONI
AU  - DILLERY, PETER
TI  - A Tannakian description of the local Kaletha gerbe
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.07042
AB  - We construct, for a p-adic field F, an explicit semisimple Tannakian category RigIsocF whose category of fiber functors recovers Kaletha’s Galois gerbe EKal. We then classify and write down the simple objects in RigIsocF , all of which come from elliptic twisted Levi subgroups of GLn.
ER  - 
